MID_LGV_1SEO_c03_Bon_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c03_Bon_m01_001: Some inconsiderate people may accost Your Majesty\nif they realize you are the queen of Saramis.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c03_Bon_m01_002: With that in mind, I thought it may be wise to\nchange your traveling attire. What do you think?
MID_LGV_1SEO_c03_Bon_m01_003: <ICA>Agree to change.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c03_Bon_m01_004: <ICB>Decline the offer.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c03_Bon_m01_007: <ACB>No? Well, the outfits will be here later should you\nchange your mind.
MID_LGA_1SEO_c03_Bon_m01: <BLN>A suggestion, if I may.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c03_Bon_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c03_Bon_m02_001: Ah, that attire suits you well, Your Majesty!
MID_LGV_1SEO_c03_Bon_m02_002: If only the late King Sergio could see you now.
MID_LGA_1SEO_c03_Bon_m02: <BLN>It suits you.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c03_Bon_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c03_Bon_m03_001: As state guests, we will be staying here for the\nduration of the Heroic Games.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c03_Bon_m03_002: It is impressive that the guesthouses here rival the\nopulence of the palace at Megaira.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c03_Bon_m03_003: This is the sort of luxury one pictures when they\nthink of Dagsion.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c03_Bon_m03_004: With its location at the center of the empire, and its\nmassive population...
MID_LGV_1SEO_c03_Bon_m03_005: one could hear all manner of intriguing things\nmerely by being here.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c03_Bon_m03_007: Shall we head to our audience with the\nDivine Sovereign?
MID_LGV_1SEO_c03_Bon_m03_008: <ICA>Say yes.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c03_Bon_m03_009: <ICB>Say no.
MID_LGA_1SEO_c03_Bon_m03: <BLN>Such luxury...
MID_LGV_1SEO_c03_Tob_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c03_Tob_m01_001: This building is something else, am I right?
MID_LGV_1SEO_c03_Tob_m01_002: <NCA>Agree with him.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c03_Tob_m01_003: <NCB>Scoff at him.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c03_Tob_m01_004: <ACA>This Divine Sovereign fella sure rolled out the red\ncarpet for us, boss.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c03_Tob_m01_005: <ACA>In fact, it might be too much for a guy like me.\nI dunno how I'm gonna sleep at night in here.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c03_Tob_m01_006: <ACB>Hey, don't knock it! It can put up all the soldiers we\nbrought, and our meals are free.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c03_Tob_m01_007: <ACB>I know the empire is rich and all, but I still say that's\nmighty generous of them.
MID_LGA_1SEO_c03_Tob_m01: <BLN>Impressive stuff!
MID_LGV_1SEO_c03_Lil_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c03_Lil_m01_001: Urgh, we came ashore a while ago and my stomach\nis still doing backflips.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c03_Lil_m01_002: I think I'm gonna throw up. Seasickness is the worst.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c03_Lil_m01_003: I had nautical training ever since I was a kid,\njust like every good little Saraminian.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c03_Lil_m01_004: But I never actually got out on the water much,\nso I must've forgotten it all.
MID_LGA_1SEO_c03_Lil_m01: <BLN>I'm gonna throw up...
MID_LGV_1SEO_c03_Lys_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c03_Lys_m01_001: The temple of Dagda we saw on the way here\nlooked like a cathedral out of a fable.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c03_Lys_m01_002: I bet it has an amazing view of the sky...
MID_LGV_1SEO_c03_Lys_m01_003: Er, pardon me, Your Majesty. I meant to say I\nhaven't seen any suspicious individuals lurking.
MID_LGA_1SEO_c03_Lys_m01: <BLN>Like a cathedral from a fable...
MID_LGV_1SEO_c03_Tob_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c03_Tob_m02_003: Y'know, Dagsion is amazing.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c03_Tob_m02_004: You can drink any water you see flowing through the\ncity, and it's always cold and delicious.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c03_Tob_m02_005: If their water's this good, I can't wait to taste\ntheir booze!
MID_LGV_1SEO_c03_Tob_m02_006: Before we're done here, I'm gonna sample every\ntavern in Dagsion!
MID_LGA_1SEO_c03_Tob_m02: <BLN>This place is amazing.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c03_Lil_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c03_Lil_m02_001: If I'm out in the big city, I might as well see the\nsights and have some fun.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c03_Lil_m02_002: As long as it's free. I don't wanna spend any money\non tourist stuff.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c03_Lil_m02_003: Maybe I can find someone to treat me to a meal...
MID_LGA_1SEO_c03_Lil_m02: <BLN>I wanna have some fun.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c03_Lys_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c03_Lys_m02_001: Some of the soldiers who accompanied us seem\nanxious about being in an unfamiliar place.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c03_Lys_m02_002: I must give them a talking-to, from one soldier of\nSaramis to another, about keeping their composure.
MID_LGA_1SEO_c03_Lys_m02: <BLN>This won't do at all.